            "notes": "you could honestly go for any of the 3 purples in any order at this point. its just situational or preference. although, [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) is better saved for later rounds unless the enemy team has a ton of debuffs/anti\u2019s stacked (junker queen, ana, [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) moira , etc.). [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) isn\u2019t as bad because of the extra overhealth on your ring from champions kit\n\naside from that, grabbing [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) would be helpful since building her ult is very slow. [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) next best bet",
