            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-07T04:41:15.970431+00:00",
            "notes": "you could go for any power you want on round 7. kind of. here\u2019s some advice from the video, though:\n\n[Black Hole](item_d9edbd0b-d1e2-4103-b8d4-6e1dc8124894) is the recommended option. very useful against brawl tanks that want to close distance like reinhardt, junker queen, etc.\n\n[Torpedo Glide](item_b04180a3-c2b2-409c-959e-77e3af6bc7d8) is very useful if you feel like you need to focus on your torpedos near the end lol\n\n[Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) isn\u2019t too bad since it can scale with AP (not very much, though. its probably better to build it with some weapon power). its not insane here, but it could be useful for you if you need to keep defending yourself from a winston, genji, etc. dive characters.\n\n[Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) could potentially be usable, but it\u2019s not certain because of its nerf\n\n[Medimaster](item_a04e1041-01c1-46ed-801e-d0590003e9b6) got a mini buff, but it probably isn\u2019t the most effective for this build. BUT, i\u2019m not your mother. grab it if you\u2019d like\n\n[Cosmic Coolant](item_5584169d-94af-4efa-955c-263353a75553) probably isn\u2019t that worth it anymore, since it got nerfed to 0.5s for each target it hits. but to each their own\n\n[Medicinal Missiles](item_30eeab6c-4a1e-4a16-b9dd-e83d633caa40) could be useful for more healing. but now that it doesn\u2019t have it\u2019s initial burst healing, it might not be worth it\n\nneither of the orbital ray powers are recommended ([Orbital Alignment](item_0200bc1e-942e-4576-bbf7-9975d2214365) & [Stellar Focus](item_25bc8bc7-d147-4759-b8ff-5be20f14633a)), as it\u2019s not a guarantee you\u2019ll build it unless you hard focus on building it. even so, it\u2019s not guaranteed that your teammates will use it",
